OL,3,GNEWSAForce sets 'ambitious' aim to
OL,4,Atackle retail crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthamptonshire Police says the rate
OL,7,Fat which offenders are brought to
OL,8,Fjustice for retail crime was almost 45%
OL,9,Flast month ` up from 15% when its
OL,10,Fretail crime team was set up in 2023.
OL,12,FInsp Adam Morrow said the rate rose to
OL,13,Fabout 70% when stores provided evidence
OL,14,Fand "worked with the force".
OL,16,FHe added: "I'm never going to be happy
OL,17,Funtil we're 100%, so we've set some
OL,18,Freally ambitious targets... to improve
OL,19,Four outcome rate."
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
