OL,3,GNEWSAForce sets 'ambitious' aim to
OL,4,Atackle retail crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FKevin Legg, the manager of Weston
OL,7,FFavell Shopping Centre in Northampton,
OL,8,Fsaid more people were shoplifting and a
OL,9,Fbetter deterrent was needed.
